       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. STRINGCONCAT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 FIRST-NAME PIC X(10) VALUE "Ada".
       01 LAST-NAME PIC X(10) VALUE "Lovelace".
       01 FULL-NAME PIC X(30).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           STRING FUNCTION TRIM(FIRST-NAME) DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  " " DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  FUNCTION TRIM(LAST-NAME) DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  INTO FULL-NAME
           DISPLAY FULL-NAME
           STOP RUN.
